observed = "cg spec done 3.1 ran verify_cmd (make test-snapshot test-state-root programs-core-test) to pass and every symbol check to pass, then failed the touch check for src/modules/programs/artifact.c because the task changed no line in it. No do_ item of task 3.1 requires editing the artifact resolver: lxp_programs_artifact_open resolves through the kernel blob store, which the new loader now restores, and req 2.5 (identical artifact bytes and identical wrong-hash refusal on a restored node) is proven by the new deploy, snapshot, restore and post-restore CALL coverage in tests/programs/test_call_activity.c."
